background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow;mso-ansi-language:TR;mso-fareast-language:
TR;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA'><font style='color:#FF0000; font-size:8px'>[16]</font></span></b></span><![endif]></span></span></i></span></a><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'>
etil alkol, metanol ve alkollü içkileri;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt'><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'>a)
Ticari amaçla üreten, bulunduran veya nakleden,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt'><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'>b)
Satışa arz eden veya satan,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt'><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'>c)
Bu özelliğini bilerek ve ticari amaçla satın alan,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt'><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'>kişi
üç yıldan altı yıla kadar hapis ve yirmi bin güne kadar adli para cezası ile
cezalandırılır. Ancak, tütün mamullerinin</span><span style='font-size:11.0pt;
color:black'>, makaron, yaprak sigara kâğıdı,</span><a style='mso-footnote-id:
ftn17' href="#_ftn17" name="_ftnref17" title=""><span
class=><i><span style='font-size:10.0pt;color:black'><span
style='mso-special-character:footnote'><![if !supportFootnotes]><span
class=><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
"Times New Roman";color:black;mso-ansi-language:TR;mso-fareast-language:TR;
mso-bidi-language:AR-SA'><font style='color:#FF0000; font-size:8px'>[17]</font></span></b></span><![endif]></span></span></i></span></a><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:"/30D2/30E9/30AE/30CE/660E/671D Pro W3"'>
etil alkol, metanol ve alkollü içkilerin kaçak olarak yurda sokulduğunun
anlaşılması hâlinde, onuncu fıkra hükmüne istinaden cezaya hükmolunur.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt'><span
style='font-size:11.0pt'>(19) </span><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span
